{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年あけましておめでとうございますヽ(・∀・)ノ\n申年"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2016年もどうぞよろしくお願い致します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/01/02/1387333/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/01/02/1387333/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さまひとりひとりには年賀状配れないので代わりにどうぞ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/01/02/1387333/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんは、早速お酒飲みましたっ⭐︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さんとお母さんとおじいちゃんと乾杯しました(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんは人並みに呑めるみたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔真っ赤になるタイプです(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良き良き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとずつ大人になっていこうと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/01/02/1387333/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2016年、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46の勢いを増す事しか出来ません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても難しい事です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"常に気を引けません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちはいろんなチャンスを頂いて素晴らしい舞台を踏ませてもらって、皆さまに応援してもらっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は乃木坂の実力でそれを皆さんに見せていきたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生き残りたいです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒里奈個人を使いたいと思っていただける様な人間になりたいですヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/01/02/1387333/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もひとつ新年のご挨拶で締めましてっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}